# This Dockerfile-specific allowlist overrides the repository's root
# .dockerignore when Compose uses the repository root as its build context.
*
!CMakeLists.txt
!pyproject.toml
!_pyproject_backend.py
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!ASSET_LICENSES.md
!cmake/
!cmake/**
!include/
!include/**
!python/
!python/**
!src/
!src/**
!tests/
!tests/cpp/
!tests/cpp/models/
!tests/cpp/models/**
!third_party/
!third_party/stb/
!third_party/stb/**
!examples/
!examples/byok/
!examples/byok/identity_copy_kernel.cpp
!examples/cosmos3_story_scene/
!examples/cosmos3_story_scene/app/
!examples/cosmos3_story_scene/app/**
!examples/cosmos3_story_scene/scripts/
!examples/cosmos3_story_scene/scripts/entrypoint.sh

# Defense in depth: generated artifacts and credentials must never be sent to
# the daemon even if a future allowlist entry becomes broader.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.bundle
**/*.engine
**/*.plan
**/*.trtfb
**/build/
**/build-*/
**/hf-cache/
/models/
/examples/cosmos3_story_scene/models/
/outputs/
/examples/cosmos3_story_scene/outputs/
/secrets/
/examples/cosmos3_story_scene/secrets/
